---
layout: layouts/base.njk
description: Lunabit Labs is an independent studio in Bahrain making calm, private apps for iPhone, iPad and Apple Watch that fit quietly into your day.
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% include "partials/lockup.svg" %}
    <p class="eyebrow">independent app studio · {{ site.place | lower }}</p>
    <h1>small apps, made with care.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Lunabit Labs makes calm, private apps for iPhone, iPad and Apple Watch that fit quietly into your day.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button" href="#apps">see the apps</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="#contact">get in touch</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="icon-row">
      {%- for app in apps %}
      <li{% if app.status != "live" %} class="soon"{% endif %}>
        <a href="/{{ app.slug }}/"><img src="/assets/apps/{{ app.slug }}-256.png" alt="" width="108" height="108"><span>{{ app.name }}</span>{% if app.status != "live" %}<small>Coming soon</small>{% endif %}</a>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="apps">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>the apps</h2>
      <p>Each one does a single job well, and gets out of the way.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="app-grid">
      {%- for app in apps %}
      {% include "partials/app-card.njk" %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>how we make them</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="principles">
      <div class="principle">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.6-3 8.4-7 10-4-1.6-7-5.4-7-10V6l7-3z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
        <h3>Private by design</h3>
        <p>No ads, no third-party trackers, and nothing sold. Each app's privacy policy says plainly what it keeps and where.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="7" y="2.5" width="10" height="19" rx="2.5"/><path d="M11 18.5h2"/></svg>
        <h3>Made for Apple devices</h3>
        <p>Built with Apple's own frameworks for iPhone, iPad and Apple Watch, so each app feels at home on your devices.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3c2.5 2.6 3.8 5.6 3.8 9s-1.3 6.4-3.8 9c-2.5-2.6-3.8-5.6-3.8-9S9.5 5.6 12 3z"/></svg>
        <h3>English and Arabic</h3>
        <p>Made in {{ site.place }}. Miqat and Thaqib are fully at home in both languages, right to left included.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section contact" id="contact">
  <div class="narrow">
    <h2>say hello</h2>
    <p>Questions, ideas, or something not working as it should? Write any time.</p>
    <a class="button" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>
  </div>
</section>
